Step 1 — Setup, install Java
git checkout develop
cd 2026b-cosc2767-a1-<your-repo-name>
mkdir question-4
cd question-4

yum install -y java-21-amazon-corretto
java -version

Step 2 — Install Maven
cd /opt
wget https://dlcdn.apache.org/maven/maven-3/3.9.9/binaries/apache-maven-3.9.9-bin.tar.gz
tar -xvzf apache-maven-3.9.9-bin.tar.gz
mv apache-maven-3.9.9 maven

Check the actual latest version at maven.apache.org/download.cgi and swap the version number if it's changed.

Set environment variables:

nano ~/.bash_profile

Add/confirm these lines:

JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-21-amazon-corretto.x86_64
M2_HOME=/opt/maven
PATH=$PATH:$JAVA_HOME/bin:$M2_HOME/bin
export JAVA_HOME M2_HOME PATH
source ~/.bash_profile
mvn -v

