Step 7 — Build
mvn package

Screenshot the terminal output showing BUILD SUCCESS

ls -la target/*.war

Screenshot confirming the file is exactly mywebsite-s123456.war

If the filename doesn't match, it's almost always because <finalName> in pom.xml wasn't saved correctly or the build used a cached target/ from before your edit — run mvn clean package instead to force a fresh build.

